">8</span><span data-type=\"name\" data-name-type=\"\" data-text=\"Dona\n                    tus\"><span data-text=\"Dona\n                    tus\" data-n=\"40\" data-lemma=\"Donatus\">Dona-<br id=\"al9-interpretive\"><span class=\"linenumber\">9</span>tus</span></span></span>  <br id=\"al10-interpretive\"><span class=\"linenumber\">10</span><span data-text=\"dono\" data-n=\"45\" data-lemma=\"donum\">d(ono)</span> · <span data-text=\"dedit\" data-n=\"55\" data-lemma=\"do\">d(edit)</span>  </span></div>  <p class=\"miniapp\"></p></div><div class=\"attribution\">Text encoding: Robert Crellin</div><div id=\"edition-interpretive-simple-lemmatized\">  <div class=\"textpart\"><span class=\"ab\" id=\"div-interpretive\">  <span data-text=\"Veneri\" data-n=\"5\" data-lemma=\"Venus\">Veneri</span>  <span data-text=\"Victrici\" data-n=\"10\" data-lemma=\"Victrix\">Victrici</span>  <span data-text=\"Hyblensi\" data-n=\"20\" data-lemma=\"Hyblensis\">Hyblensi</span>  <span data-text=\"Caius\" data-n=\"30\" data-lemma=\"Caius\">Caius</span>  <span data-text=\"Publicius\" data-n=\"35\" data-lemma=\"Publicius\">Publicius</span>  <span data-text=\"Donatus\" data-n=\"40\" data-lemma=\"Donatus\">Donatus</span>  <span data-text=\"dono\" data-n=\"45\" data-lemma=\"donum\">dono</span>  <span data-text=\"dedit\" data-n=\"55\" data-lemma=\"do\">dedit</span>  </span></div>  <p class=\"miniapp\"></p></div><div class=\"attribution\">Text encoding: Jonathan Prag</div><div id=\"edition-diplomatic\" lang=\"la\"><div class=\"textpart\" lang=\"la\"><span class=\"ab\" id=\"div-diplomatic\"><a id=\"al1-diplomatic\"><!--0--></a><span class=\"linenumber\">1</span><span data-type=\"persname\" data-name-type=\"divine\" data-text=\"Vene\n                    ri\n                    Victri\n                    ci ·\n                    Hyblen\n                    si\"><span data-type=\"name\" data-name-type=\"\" data-text=\"Vene\n                    ri\"><span data-text=\"Vene\n                    ri\" data-n=\"5\" data-lemma=\"Venus\">VENE<br id=\"al2-diplomatic\"><span class=\"linenumber\">2</span>RI</span></span><br id=\"al3-diplomatic\"><span class=\"linenumber\">3</span><span data-type=\"name\" data-name-type=\"epithet\" data-text=\"Victri\n                    ci\"><span data-text=\"Victri\n                    ci\" data-n=\"10\" data-lemma=\"Victrix\">VICTRI<br id=\"al4-diplomatic\"><span class=\"linenumber\">4</span>CI</span></span>·<br id=\"al5-diplomatic\"><span class=\"linenumber\">5</span><span data-type=\"name\" data-name-type=\"\" data-text=\"Hyblen\n                    si\"><span data-text=\"Hyblen\n                    si\" data-n=\"20\" data-lemma=\"Hyblensis\">HYBLEN<br id=\"al6-diplomatic\"><span class=\"linenumber\">6</span>SI</span></span></span>·<br id=\"al7-diplomatic\"><span class=\"linenumber\">7</span><span data-type=\"persname\" data-name-type=\"attested\" data-text=\"Caius Publicius\n                    Dona\n                    tus\"><span data-type=\"name\" data-name-type=\"\" data-text=\"Caius\"><span data-text=\"Caius\" data-n=\"30\" data-lemma=\"Caius\">C</span></span><span data-type=\"name\" data-name-type=\"\" data-text=\"Publicius\"><span data-text=\"Publicius\" data-n=\"35\" data-lemma=\"Publicius\">PUBLIC</span></span><br id=\"al8-diplomatic\"><span class=\"linenumber\">8</span><span data-type=\"name\" data-name-type=\"\" data-text=\"Dona\n                    tus\"><span data-text=\"Dona\n                    tus\" data-n=\"40\" data-lemma=\"Donatus\">DONA<br id=\"al9-diplomatic\"><span class=\"linenumber\">9</span>TUS</span></span></span><br id=\"al10-diplomatic\"><span class=\"linenumber\">10</span><span data-text=\"dono\" data-n=\"45\" data-lemma=\"donum\">D</span>·<span data-text=\"dedit\" data-n=\"55\" data-lemma=\"do\">D</span></span></div><p class=\"miniapp\"></p></div><div class=\"attribution\">Text encoding: Robert Crellin</div><div id=\"edition-diplomatic-simple-lemmatized\"><div class=\"textpart\"><span class=\"ab\" id=\"div-diplomatic\"><span data-text=\"Veneri\" data-n=\"5\" data-lemma=\"Venus\">VENERI</span><span data-text=\"Victrici\" data-n=\"10\" data-lemma=\"Victrix\">VICTRICI</span><span data-text=\"Hyblensi\" data-n=\"20\" data-lemma=\"Hyblensis\">HYBLENSI</span><span data-text=\"Caius\" data-n=\"30\" data-lemma=\"Caius\">CAIUS</span><span data-text=\"Publicius\" data-n=\"35\" data-lemma=\"Publicius\">PUBLICIUS</span><span data-text=\"Donatus\" data-n=\"40\" data-lemma=\"Donatus\">DONATUS</span><span data-text=\"dono\" data-n=\"45\" data-lemma=\"donum\">DONO</span><span data-text=\"dedit\" data-n=\"55\" data-lemma=\"do\">DEDIT</span></span></div><p class=\"miniapp\"></p></div></div>  <div id=\"facsimile-images\"><h2>Facsimile Images</h2><a href=\"ISic000297_tiled.tif\"><img title=\"Photograph of front face by students of  Liceo M.M. Lazzaro\" src=\"ISic000297_tiled-thumb.tif\"></a><a href=\"ISic000297.jpg\"><img title=\"Photograph of front face by students of Liceo M.M. Lazzaro\" src=\"ISic000297-thumb.jpg\"></a></div>  <div id=\"apparatus\"><h4>Apparatus criticus</h4><ul><li><span>  <span>Text of Prag based on autopsy</span>  </span></li></ul></div>  <div id=\"translation\"><h2>English translation</h2><p class=\"translation-author\"><a href=\"http://orcid.org/0000-0003-3819-8537\">Jonathan Prag</a></p>  <p>(Dedicated to) Venus Victrix Hyblensis. Caius Publicius Donatus gave this as a gift.</p>  </div>  <div id=\"translation\"><h2>Italian translation</h2><p class=\"translation-author\">Serena Agodi</p>  <p>Alla Venere Vincitrice ibleense Caio Publicio Donato offrì in dono.</p>  </div>  <div id=\"commentary\"><h2>commentary</h2>  <p>This statue base is the only Latin inscription from Paternò, and is important both for its dedication to Venus Victrix (Venus Victorious) and for the reference to Hybla. This is the only dedication to Venus Victrix from Sicily, although dedications are found across the Roman Empire, especially in the northern and western provinces. The epithet ‘Hyblensis’, ‘of Hybla’ provides important evidence (but not proof) for the identification of Paternò with ancient Hybla Gereatis, although at least two cities in ancient Sicily were called Hybla. The statue was already missing when the base was found, but there is good evidence for the Venus Victrix type, principally from Roman coins from the time of Julius Caesar onwards.</p>  </div>  <div id=\"bibliography\"><h2>bibliography</h2>  <ul><li> Mommsen 1883 <a href=\"http://arachne.uni-koeln.de/item/buchseite/650754\" target=\"_blank\">7013</a>  <a href=\"https://biblio.inscriptiones.org/epig10000589\" target=\"_blank\">https://biblio.inscriptiones.org/epig10000589</a>  </li><li> Pace 1945 508 fig.137 <a href=\"https://biblio.inscriptiones.org/epig10001691\" target=\"_blank\">https://biblio.inscriptiones.org/epig10001691</a>  </li><li> Manganaro 1964 433 <a href=\"https://biblio.inscriptiones.org/epig10001845\" target=\"_blank\">https://biblio.inscriptiones.org/epig10001845</a>  </li><li> Manganaro 1977 153 <a href=\"https://biblio.inscriptiones.org/epig10001440\" target=\"_blank\">https://biblio.inscriptiones.org/epig10001440</a>  </li><li> Manganaro 1988 67 <a href=\"https://biblio.inscriptiones.org/epig10001427\" target=\"_blank\">https://biblio.inscriptiones.org/epig10001427</a>  </li><li> Wilson 1990 292 <a href=\"https://biblio.inscriptiones.org/epig10001509\" target=\"_blank\">https://biblio.inscriptiones.org/epig10001509</a>  </li><li> Manganaro 1996 54 <a href=\"https://biblio.inscriptiones.org/epig10001818\" target=\"_blank\">https://biblio.inscriptiones.org/epig10001818</a>  </li><li> Manganaro 2000 151 ph <a href=\"https://biblio.inscriptiones.org/epig10001811\" target=\"_blank\">https://biblio.inscriptiones.org/epig10001811</a>  </li><li> Trotta 2000 158 <a href=\"https://biblio.inscriptiones.org/epig10001554\" target=\"_blank\">https://biblio.inscriptiones.org/epig10001554</a>  </li><li> Korhonen 2004 237 <a href=\"https://biblio.inscriptiones.org/epig10000028\" target=\"_blank\">https://biblio.inscriptiones.org/epig10000028</a>  </li></ul>  <ul><li></li></ul>  </div>  <div id=\"handnote\"> <p>Deeply, but rather irregularly cut letters. Y and T are tall, as is I in line 4; R is closed. Interpuncts in the form of a comma.</p> Line 1-10  12-29      </div><div id=\"license\"> Licensed under a Creative Commons-Attribution 4.0 licence. </div>",
